# Nothing generated lives here: no build step, no bundler, no node_modules — `.types/` is a
# symlink farm into pi's own global install (built by `node tests/typecheck.mjs`), and pi
# loads the .ts files directly.
# So this file exists only to keep editor/OS droppings and a stray local install out.
node_modules/
.types/
*.log
*.bak
.DS_Store

# Design docs and review transcripts stay LOCAL. They quote a consuming project's private source
# by file:line, its internal engineering docs verbatim, and measured counts from its corpus — none
# of which belongs in a public repository. The commit messages carry the reasoning that matters;
# the evidence trail lives beside this checkout, not inside it.
/docs/
